data: {"query":"他有哪些论文","query_type":"canonical_v2:A:answer","answer_text":"你问的这篇论文是《Ultra-high sensitivity Fabry–Perot interferometer gas refractive index fiber sensor based on photonic crystal fiber and Vernier effect》，作者为 Mingran Quan、Jiajun Tian、Yong Yao，2015 年发表于 Optics Letters。该工作提出并验证了一种基于光子晶体光纤与 Vernier 效应的开放式腔法布里–珀罗干涉仪气体折射率传感器，实验测得折射率灵敏度高达 30899 nm/RIU，可用于气体浓度分析与湿度监测等场景。\n\n从作者署名线索看，Yong Yao 还参与过以下论文：\n\n- 《Reversal of optical binding force by Fano resonance in plasmonic nanorod heterodimer》，作者包括 Q. Zhang、Jun‐Jun Xiao、X. M. Zhang、Yong Yao、Hui Liu，2013 年发表于 Optics Express，研究等离激元纳米棒异二聚体中 Fano 共振导致的光学结合力反转。\n- 《An Ultra-Compact 3-dB Power Splitter for Three Modes Based on Pixelated Meta-Structure》，作者包括 Hucheng Xie、Yingjie Liu、Yuhan Wang、Yujie Wang、Yong Yao、Qinghai Song，2020 年发表于 IEEE Photonics Technology Letters，报道了一种基于像素化超结构的超紧凑三模 3-dB 功率分束器。\n- 《High-speed silicon photonic Mach–Zehnder modulator at 2 μm》，作者包括 Xi Wang、Weihong Shen、Wenxiang Li、Yingjie Liu、Yong Yao、Jiangbing Du，2021 年发表于 Photonics Research，展示了面向 2 μm 波段的高速硅基马赫–曾德尔调制器，调制速率可达 80 Gbit/s。\n\n以上是基于当前可确认署名关系整理出的论文清单，可能并非其全部成果。如果你更关心某位具体作者或某个研究方向（如光纤传感、硅光器件）的论文，我可以再帮你深入梳理。","citations":[{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-23703260af8b9901","label":"Ultra-high sensitivity Fabry–Perot interferometer gas refractive index fiber sensor based on photonic crystal fiber and Vernier effect","url":"https://doi.org/10.1364/ol.40.004891"},{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-c0eed461b00a962d","label":"Reversal of optical binding force by Fano resonance in plasmonic nanorod heterodimer","url":"https://doi.org/10.1364/oe.21.006601"},{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-667a8a2afcc1934c","label":"An Ultra-Compact 3-dB Power Splitter for Three Modes Based on Pixelated Meta-Structure","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/lpt.2020.2975128"},{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-39c1c3b2e0f344b1","label":"High-speed silicon photonic Mach–Zehnder modulator at 2 μm","url":"https://doi.org/10.1364/prj.417107"}],"evidence":[],"clarification":null,"structured_payload":{},"answer_style":"llm_synthesized","citation_map":{"1":"official-source-23703260af8b9901","2":"official-source-c0eed461b00a962d","3":"official-source-667a8a2afcc1934c","4":"official-source-39c1c3b2e0f344b1"},"suggested_followups":[]}

